# Workshop ids of the mod's HARD dependencies that the staging script's built-in table does not
# know. Read in every pass, the bare one included; it resolves without activating anything.
#
# hekmo.FlavorText is a hard dependency (About.xml) and is not in the shared table.
hekmo.FlavorText   3245374432
#
# nelim.flavortextextended, the other hard dependency, is published on GitHub only and has no
# Workshop id. The script only looks a dependency up as a FOLDER NAME inside its Workshop
# directories, so the "id" below is a folder name, not a number: a symbolic link of that name in
# the WSL workshop cache points at the local mod. It is a one-time setup on each machine and it is
# not in this repository; see README.md, "Staging".
nelim.flavortextextended   FlavorTextExtended
